  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• Drain pineapple slices and reserve some pineapple juice (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3ac16e6df74d078e46882-df63f5c2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook pineapple slices until lightly charred, 2-3 minutes each side.\n• Transfer to a chopping board and roughly chop.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3ac16e6df74d078e46882-88962106.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3ac16e6df74d078e46882-a7a6605e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine garlic aioli, soy sauce mix, sweet chilli sauce and the reserved pineapple juice.\n• Add tofu, slaw mix, mixed salad leaves, tomato and pineapple. Toss to coat and season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Divide Thai tofu and pineapple salad between bowls.\n• Garnish with chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3ac16e6df74d078e46882-f83bb6da.jpeg"
    }
  ]
